tes several software packages and presents a unified interface for both biologists and developers. Scipion allows you to execute workflows combining different software tools, while taking care of formats and conversions. Additionally, all steps are tracked and can be reproduced later on.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>Scipion is an image processing framework for obtaining 3D models of macromolecular complexes using Electron Microscopy (3DEM). It integrates several software packages and presents a unified interface for both biologists and developers. Scipion allows you to execute workflows combining different software tools, while taking care of formats and conversions. Additionally, all steps are tracked and can be reproduced later on.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-10-13T14:58:51+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-08-21T10:27:31+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"Please cite the following url when citing Scipion: <a href=\"http://scipion.cnb.csic.es/docs/bin/view/TWiki/WebHome\">http://scipion.cnb.csic.es/docs/bin/view/TWiki/WebHome</a>.","value":"Please cite the following url when citing Scipion: http://scipion.cnb.csic.es/docs/bin/view/TWiki/WebHome. "}],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":14,"comment_count":1,"last_comment_name":"","last_comment_timestamp":1507906781,"last_comment_uid":1,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"J.M. de la Rosa Trev\u00edn  orcid.org/0000-0002-3320-1269"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":1,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"ff7211b9-a937-4c33-aac3-22aa10053480","url":"/user/1"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4192,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2928","url":"/alignment-construction"},{"target_id":4032,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_u